   "text": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\" class=\"js-notloaded\"><head><title>Events – Princeville at Hanalei</title> </head><body class=\"subpage events\"><header class=\"header fixed-top align-items-center header-down\"><div class=\"container d-flex align-items-center\"><div class=\"logo\"><h1><a href=\"https://www.princeville.com/\" title=\"Events Calendar\">Events Calendar</a></h1></div></div></header><section class=\"masthead\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row justify-content-md-center\"><div class=\"col-md-12\"><h1>Events</h1></div><div class=\"col-lg-8 col-md-10 col-sm-12\"><h2>Don't miss out on the exciting events being held on Princeville. Visit these special events and programs that highlight the neighboring communities.</h2></div></div></div></section><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"eventssection\"><div class=\"container-fluid\"><div class=\"row justify-content-center calendarmonths\"><div class=\"col-md-5 calmenu-title\"><h2>Upcoming Events</h2></div><div class=\"col-md-5 calmenu-container\"><div class=\"row justify-content-center\"><div class=\"col-sm-1 col-md-1 btnprev-container\"><a href=\"/events/2026/10#main\" title=\"View Previous Month\"><div class=\"calendar-buttonprev\"></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-4 col-md-4 selectedmonth\">November 2026</div><div class=\"col-sm-1 col-md-1 btnnext-container\"><a href=\"/events/2026/12#main\" title=\"View Next Month\"><div class=\"calendar-buttonnext\"></div></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"container eventlistcontainer\"><div class=\"row justify-content-center eventitem\" data-aos=\"fade-in\" data-aos-delay=\"0\"><div class=\"eventimgcontainer col-md-4 col-sm-12\"><div class=\"eventimg\"></div><div class=\"eventdate\"><span class=\"eventdate-day\">Tue</span><br><span class=\"eventdate-daynumber\">03</span><br><span class=\"eventdate-month\">Nov</span></div></div><div class=\"eventcopy-container col-md-5 col-sm-12\"><div class=\"eventcopy\"><h3>Waipā Farmers Market</h3><p><span class=\"eventlocation\">Location: <a href=\"https://waipafoundation.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener\" title=\"Waipā Farmers Market\">Waipā Foundation</a></span><span class=\"eventtime\">Tuesdays, Time: 2:00 pm - 5:00 pm</span></p><p>Waipā farmers market happens every Tuesday. Local vendors offering fresh and mostly organic veggies, fruits, flowers and a variety of foods and crafts. Call for details: 808-555-0100</p></div></div></div><div class=\"row justify-content-center eventitem\" data-aos=\"fade-in\" data-aos-delay=\"3\"><div class=\"eventimgcontainer col-md-4 col-sm-12\"><div class=\"eventimg lazyload\" data-bg=\"/assets/img/events/makai-festival-380x220-v2.jpg\"></div><div class=\"eventdate\"><span class=\"eventdate-day\">Wed</span><br><span class=\"eventdate-daynumber\">04</span><br><span class=\"eventdate-month\">Nov</span></div></div><div class=\"eventcopy-container col-md-5 col-sm-12\"><div class=\"eventcopy\"><h3>Makai Music &amp; Art Festival</h3><p><span class=\"eventlocation\">Location: <a href=\"https://www.makaigolf.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener\" title=\"Makai Music &amp; Art Festival\">Princeville Makai Golf Club</a></span><span class=\"eventtime\">Wednesdays, Time: 1:00 pm – 5:00 pm</span></p><p>Wonderfull blend of local vendors, artisans and musicians in a beautiful place for guests to enjoy.\tTaking place each Wednesday on the Princeville Makai Golf Club tennis court lawn. Call for details: 808-555-0100</p></div></div></div><div class=\"row justify-content-center eventitem\" data-aos=\"fade-in\" data-aos-delay=\"6\"><div class=\"eventimgcontainer col-md-4 col-sm-12\"><div class=\"eventimg lazyload\" data-bg=\"/assets/img/events/hanaleifarmers-market-v2-380x220.jpg\"></div><div class=\"eventdate\"><span class=\"eventdate-day\">Sat</span><br><span class=\"eventdate-daynumber\">07</span><br><span class=\"eventdate-month\">Nov</span></div></div><div class=\"eventcopy-container col-md-5 col-sm-12\"><div class=\"eventcopy\"><h3>Hanalei Farmers Market</h3><p><span class=\"eventlocation\">Location: <a href=\"https://halehalawai.org/farmers-market\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener\" title=\"Hanalei Farmers Market\">Hale Halawai, Hanalei</a></span><span class=\"eventtime\">Saturdays, Time: 9:00 am - 12:00 pm</span></p><p>Join us for a delightful experience featuring fresh, locally grown fruits and vegetables from Kauai’s North Shore farmers, along with scrumptious, freshly baked goods and other delectable treats! Call for details: 808-555-0100</p></div></div></div><div class=\"row justify-content-center eventitem\" data-aos=\"fade-in\" data-aos-delay=\"9\"><div class=\"eventimgcontainer col-md-4 col-sm-12\"><div class=\"eventimg lazyload\" data-bg=\"/assets/img/events/anainahou-farmersmarket-380x220.jpg\"></div><div class=\"eventdate\"><span class=\"eventdate-day\">Sat</span><br><span class=\"eventdate-daynumber\">07</span><br><span class=\"eventdate-month\">Nov</span></div></div><div class=\"eventcopy-container col-md-5 col-sm-12\"><div class=\"eventcopy\"><h3>Anaina Hou Farmers Market</h3><p><span class=\"eventlocation\">Location: <a href=\"https://anainahou.org/farmers-market/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener\" title=\"Anaina Hou Farmers Market\">Anaina Hou Community Park</a></span><span class=\"eventtime\">Saturdays, Time: 9:00 am - 12:00 pm</span></p><p>Come help support local farmers, artists and boost the lively economy of Kauai. Special vendors display the finest Kauai-grown fruits and vegetables along with genuine crafts made in Kauai. Call for details: 808-555-0100</p></div></div></div><div class=\"row justify-content-center eventitem\" data-aos=\"fade-in\" data-aos-delay=\"12\"><div class=\"eventimgcontainer col-md-4 col-sm-12\"><div class=\"eventimg lazyload\" data-bg=\"/assets/img/events/princevillecenter-hula-380x220.jpg\"></div><div class=\"eventdate\"><span class=\"eventdate-day\">Sat</span><br><span class=\"eventdate-daynumber\">07</span><br><span class=\"eventdate-month\">Nov</span></div></div><div class=\"eventcopy-container col-md-5 col-sm-12\"><div class=\"eventcopy\"><h3>Princeville Center Hula Show</h3><p><span class=\"eventlocation\">Location: <a href=\"https://www.princevillecenter.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener\" title=\"Princeville Center Hula Show\">Princeville Center</a></span><span class=\"eventtime\">Saturdays, Time: 1:30 pm – 2:30 pm</span></p><p>Aunty Bev’s Hula Halau takes the stage every Saturday at the Food Court. Enjoy a cultural experience like no other during a weekly Hula Show. Performers use music, chanting, and movement to tell the story of Kaua‘i. Call for details: 808-555-0100</p></div></div></div><div class=\"row justify-content-center eventitem\" data-aos=\"fade-in\" data-aos-delay=\"15\"><div class=\"eventimgcontainer col-md-4 col-sm-12\"><div class=\"eventimg lazyload\" data-bg=\"/assets/img/events/princeville-market-380x220.jpg\"></div><div class=\"eventdate\"><span class=\"eventdate-day\">Sun</span><br><span class=\"eventdate-daynumber\">08</span><br><span class=\"eventdate-month\">Nov</span></div></div><div class=\"eventcopy-container col-md-5 col-sm-12\"><div class=\"eventcopy\"><h3>Princeville Night Market</h3><p><span class=\"eventlocation\">Location: <a href=\"https://www.princevillecenter.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener\" title=\"Princeville Night Market\">Princeville Center</a></span><span class=\"eventtime\">Sunday, Time: 4:00 pm – 8:00 pm</span></p><p>Come join us at the Princeville Center Night Market. Food trucks, LIVE music, and pop-up shopping with local vendors. On the second Sunday of each month. Email for details: someone@example.org</p></div></div></div><div class=\"row justify-content-center eventitem\" data-aos=\"fade-in\" data-aos-delay=\"18\"><div class=\"eventimgcontainer col-md-4 col-sm-12\"><div class=\"eventimg lazyload\" data-bg=\"/assets/img/events/waipamarket-475x275.jpg\"></div><div class=\"eventdate\"><span class=\"eventdate-day\">Tue</span><br><span class=\"eventdate-daynumber\">10</span><br><span class=\"eventdate-month\">Nov</span></div></div><div class=\"eventcopy-container col-md-5 col-sm-12\"><div class=\"eventcopy\"><h3>Waipā Farmers Market</h3><p><span class=\"eventlocation\">Location: <a href=\"https://waipafoundation.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener\" title=\"Waipā Farmers Market\">Waipā Foundation</a></span><span class=\"eventtime\">Tuesdays, Time: 2:00 pm - 5:00 pm</span></p><p>Waipā farmers market happens every Tuesday. Local vendors offering fresh and mostly organic veggies, fruits, flowers and a variety of foods and crafts. Call for details: 808-555-0100</p></div></div></div><div class=\"row justify-content-center eventitem\" data-aos=\"fade-in\" data-aos-delay=\"21\"><div class=\"eventimgcontainer col-md-4 col-sm-12\"><div class=\"eventimg lazyload\" data-bg=\"/assets/img/events/makai-festival-380x220-v2.jpg\"></div><div class=\"eventdate\"><span class=\"eventdate-day\">Wed</span><br><span class=\"eventdate-daynumber\">11</span><br><span class=\"eventdate-month\">Nov</span></div></div><div class=\"eventcopy-container col-md-5 col-sm-12\"><div class=\"eventcopy\"><h3>Makai Music &amp; Art Festival</h3><p><span class=\"eventlocation\">Location: <a href=\"https://www.makaigolf.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener\" title=\"Makai Music &amp; Art Festival\">Princeville Makai Golf Club</a></span><span class=\"eventtime\">Wednesdays, Time: 1:00 pm – 5:00 pm</span></p><p>Wonderfull blend of local vendors, artisans and musicians in a beautiful place for guests to enjoy.\tTaking place each Wednesday on the Princeville Makai Golf Club tennis court lawn. Call for details: 808-555-0100</p></div></div></div><div class=\"container eventnotes-container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-md-12\"><p>*Note: Date, times and activities subject to change due to scheduling considerations, weather conditions, etc.</p></div></div></div></div></section></main><div class=\"back-to-top\"><button><span class=\"arrow-left\"></span> Back To Top</button></div> <script type=\"application/ld+json\"> { \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Princeville at Hanalei\", \"url\": \"https://www.princeville.com/\", \"logo\": \"https://www.princeville.com/assets/img/princevillelogo-fff-horizontal.svg\", \"sameAs\": \"https://www.instagram.com/princevilleathanalei/\" } </script></body></html>"
